    "plain_json": "ordinary JSON document value with no portable Value envelope"
  },
  "global_requirements": [
    "Protected is a v1 requirement, not a claim that a pinned implementation already encrypts payloads.",
    "Protection is boundary-aware; diagnostic kind strings, generic codec hooks and external-upload allowlists are not AAD or protection admission.",
    "Strict enabled mode suppresses every parallel plaintext projection and refuses every raw fallback for a protected boundary.",
    "Unsupported boundaries refuse before encoding or upload even when their current transport happens to use an Avro Value envelope.",
    "Absent optional arguments retain omission semantics and do not create an empty protected value."
  ],
